AB  - Engelbart argued that groups should improve the way they improve. We propose three operational measures of a research team's collective capability, namely time-to-reuse of prior work, cross-member retrieval success and decision traceability, and pilot them with four lab groups over eight weeks. Teams with shared, searchable records had faster reuse but not better traceability.
